WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.736
-We don't always
have enough time

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:04.504
to cover all of the recent news.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.040
So here with a recap is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.242
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What?"

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:12.311
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:15.448
-You guys,
things have been crazy!

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:18.984
Okay, first of all,
I heard Jimmy Buffett

00:00:18.984 --> 00:00:22.155
sang the national anthem
and dropped the mic!

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:24.024
And I was like, "What?"

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:26.893
Jimmy Buffett
sang the national anthem?

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:28.327
Where?

00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:30.430
At a game of beer pong?

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.464
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:34.200
Jimmy Buffett
dropped the mic why?

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.237
Did he sing
the national anthem well?

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:41.674
'Cause I heard "Margaritaville,"
and I'm guessing that's a no.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:42.708
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:45.178
Also, you're too old
to drop a mic.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:48.247
Barack Obama
barely got away with it.

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:51.317
When you -- When Barack Obama
drops a mic, it's cool.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:53.586
But when you
start dropping things,

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:56.456
your children come around
to check on you.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:57.590
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.625
Then I was watching Fox News,

00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:01.093
where they
accidentally announced

00:01:01.093 --> 00:01:04.330
that Ruth Bader Ginsburg died,
even though she's still alive.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.132
And I was like, "What?!"

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:08.568
Just kidding.
I wasn't watching Fox News.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.803
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:12.404
But --

00:01:12.404 --> 00:01:14.506
I was watching "True Detective."
It was fun.

00:01:14.506 --> 00:01:16.442
But I heard about it.

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:17.843
And I was like, "What?!"

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:20.780
You showed this
on national television?

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.181
Why?

00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:25.951
Were you hoping that she'd
see it and go, "Oh, I'm dead.

00:01:25.951 --> 00:01:27.420
Okay. Eh."

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.054
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.054 --> 00:01:33.492
Then Beto O'Rourke was like,
"I might run for president."

00:01:33.492 --> 00:01:35.194
And everyone was like, "What?!"

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:38.798
Then Elizabeth Warren was like,
"I'm gonna run for president!"

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.466
And everyone was like, "What?"

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:43.469
Then Kamala Harris was like...

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:45.638
And I was like...

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:47.272
And then she was like...

00:01:47.272 --> 00:01:49.242
And then I was like...

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:53.446
And then she was like...
"I'm running for president!"

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:56.082
[ Cheers and applause ]
Oh, man.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:01.320
Everybody was like, "What?"

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:05.925
Then I saw that Beyoncé
shopped at a Target.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.294
And I was like, "What...

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:12.298
could they possibly have
that you need?"

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:14.100
Is it mirrors?

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.135
It was probably mirrors.

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:19.772
Then some scuba divers
off the coast of Hawaii

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:21.207
were minding their own business

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:24.443
when a giant great white shark
showed up.

00:02:24.443 --> 00:02:26.212
And I was like, "What?!"

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:29.415
Then this fool touched it.

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:34.354
Now, I'm not a shark expert,
snorkeling expert, or swimmer.

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:38.157
I don't like water, animals, or
animals that live in the water.

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:41.260
But I do know that sharks
eat people, idiot!

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.463
And you look delicious!

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:46.399
So you may not want
to be swimming up to sharks

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:48.434
like they're your best friend!

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:51.036
I did all that without
mentioning the song "Baby Shark"

00:02:51.036 --> 00:02:52.704
lest it get stuck in your head.

00:02:52.704 --> 00:02:54.007
Oops, I mentioned it.

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:55.674
Guess it's stuck
in your head now!

00:02:55.674 --> 00:02:57.076
[ Laughs ]

00:02:57.076 --> 00:03:04.083
Then Gillette aired a commercial
acknowledging toxic masculinity,

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:06.819
saying, "We have to stop saying
'boys will be boys,'"

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:09.255
and I was like, "Yes, we do.
What, what, what, what, what?"

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:12.792
Then some people
didn't like being told

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:14.260
they shouldn't bully and rape.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.762
And I was like, "What?"

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:19.132
Sounds like you've mistaken
toxic masculinity

00:03:19.132 --> 00:03:20.533
for your identity.

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:23.836
And the second I said that,
I became an old black lady.

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:25.871
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.871 --> 00:03:29.709
Then a bunch of children from
Covington Catholic High School

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:33.779
went on a trip to D.C. to march
against reproductive rights.

00:03:33.779 --> 00:03:36.716
And they thought, "While we're
doing some sexist [bleep]

00:03:36.716 --> 00:03:39.284
why don't we also
do some racist [bleep]"

00:03:39.284 --> 00:03:42.655
So when --

00:03:42.655 --> 00:03:45.158
I mean, whew,
like a mug, though.

00:03:45.158 --> 00:03:47.359
When some indigenous people

00:03:47.359 --> 00:03:49.528
who were having a separate march
approached them,

00:03:49.528 --> 00:03:51.064
the kids mocked them.

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:53.365
And I was all like, "What?"

00:03:53.365 --> 00:03:55.434
Didn't you see
the Gillette commercial?

00:03:55.434 --> 00:03:58.504
This is what "boys will be boys"
does to people.

00:03:58.504 --> 00:04:01.273
Now, these parents
need to sit down

00:04:01.273 --> 00:04:03.642
and explain to their children
that this is wrong.

00:04:03.642 --> 00:04:05.878
Or -- and this is
an official pitch --

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:10.249
NBC makes a "Scared Straight"
reboot but for racist children.

00:04:10.249 --> 00:04:13.118
Now, you send your little
racist children to me.

00:04:13.118 --> 00:04:15.421
What am I gonna do to them?
None of your business.

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:20.393
But when you get them back,
they will not be racist!

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:21.727
Then...

00:04:21.727 --> 00:04:23.196
[ Cheers and applause ]
Listen up.

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:30.235
Then Karen Pence
took a job teaching art

00:04:30.235 --> 00:04:31.904
at a Christian school

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:35.341
that doesn't allow LGBT students
or teachers.

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:38.978
And I heard that and was like,
"What...did you expect?

00:04:38.978 --> 00:04:41.580
She's married to this guy."

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:45.317
Then I had an idea.
And this is an official pitch.

00:04:45.317 --> 00:04:48.654
NBC makes a show called "Scared
of People Who Aren't Straight"

00:04:48.654 --> 00:04:51.257
where kids send
their homophobic parents to me.

00:04:51.257 --> 00:04:54.293
Now, what am I gonna do to them?
None of your business.

00:04:54.293 --> 00:04:58.197
But when you get them back,
they will not be homophobic!

00:04:58.197 --> 00:05:00.433
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:04.303 --> 00:05:07.440
Then the best thing
in the world happened!

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:10.142
Katelyn Ohashi did
a gymnastics routine

00:05:10.142 --> 00:05:12.478
that had everybody like,
"What?!"

00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:14.714
Whoo!
It was beautiful!

00:05:14.714 --> 00:05:17.249
Her floor exercise
had all the hits --

00:05:17.249 --> 00:05:20.953
"Proud Mary," "September,"
"Rhythm Nation."

00:05:20.953 --> 00:05:24.457
And then she did something
I will never forget

00:05:24.457 --> 00:05:26.392
I saw another human being do.

00:05:26.392 --> 00:05:27.627
This!

00:05:32.899 --> 00:05:34.500
[ Audience "Ohs" ]

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.202
Oh!

00:05:36.202 --> 00:05:39.172
What?!

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:42.174
Yeah! Yeah!

00:05:42.174 --> 00:05:44.843
Am I doing it?
Probably close.

00:05:44.843 --> 00:05:48.347
I saw that, picked up
Jimmy Buffett's microphone,

00:05:48.347 --> 00:05:50.049
and dropped it again!

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:51.751
This has been "Amber Says What?"

00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:54.319
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:54.319 --> 00:05:57.423
-Amber Ruffin, everybody!

